&lt;h1&gt;


  My First Post on DEV
&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone! 👋&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I'm Aditya, a developer from India. I've been spending most of my time learning how to build web applications and, more importantly, understanding what actually goes into building a product from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Right now, I'm working on &lt;strong&gt;BuildKiwi&lt;/strong&gt;, a project where developers can share what they're building and discover projects from other developers.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I work mostly with React, TypeScript, Node.js, and MongoDB, and lately I've been getting more interested in the backend and product side of things too. There's still a lot I don't know, but that's probably the fun part.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I joined DEV because I want to meet more developers, make some new friends, share what I'm learning, and learn from people who are building things themselves.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I'll be sharing my projects, things I learn, problems I run into, and probably a few mistakes along the way &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Anyway, just wanted to say &lt;strong&gt;hello&lt;/strong&gt; and introduce myself.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Looking forward to meeting you all! &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you're building something right now, feel free to tell me about it. I'd love to check it out.&lt;/p&gt;

